667
00:43:22.327 --> 00:43:25.411
- Damn, he's quick.
- Well done, sir.

668
00:43:26.077 --> 00:43:26.702
Let's go.

669
00:43:26.703 --> 00:43:28.369
Yes, sir.

670
00:43:50.952 --> 00:43:52.786
