725
00:46:47.687 --> 00:46:50.771
Hey, ever heard of the “Room of Truth”?

726
00:46:51.354 --> 00:46:54.771
If you don't talk now,
he'll kill you first.

727
00:46:57.312 --> 00:46:59.771
