800
00:53:08.227 --> 00:53:10.643
Yes, we'll need to visit
and check each one.

801
00:53:11.196 --> 00:53:16.112
<i>A man was found dead in a
container at Incheon Customs.</i>

802
00:53:16.113 --> 00:53:19.279
<i>Police suspect foul
play and are examining</i>

803
00:53:19.280 --> 00:53:21.987
<i>nearby CCTV footage for possible leads.</i>

804
00:53:21.988 --> 00:53:23.988
<i>More from the reporter on this.</i>

805
00:53:24.363 --> 00:53:28.487
<i>At 8:30 this morning, a
body was found in a container</i>

806
00:53:28.488 --> 00:53:32.238
